trait-language-lepidic-name = Lepidic
trait-language-lepidic-desc = The language of the Mothfolk, composed of various chitters and squeaks. Almost completely unintelligible to those who can't understand it.
trait-language-scurretsign-name = Scurret Sign
trait-language-scurretsign-desc = You've picked up on how to communicate in the complex sign language of the Scurrets, but not without a cost. Your knowledge of the common tongue is beginning to slip…
